    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842050/extras/8feebc58930b68ea7f7c68d1ec3ae180.avif?t=1720184434\" width=606 height=613 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842050/extras/fac7566fad9f67a251423b8dc68b93d0.avif?t=1720184434\" width=616 height=158 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842050/extras/1579f5a4b40abf703baa01385b5aa431.avif?t=1720184434\" width=616 height=80 /></span><br>Manage a medieval tavern in the middle of heaven and hell!<br>Build &amp; expand your tavern by adding new floors and furniture. Recruit humans, angels or demons as workers.<br><br>Build new floors to reach the heaven or build through the underground to reach hell.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842050/extras/ebd397a81c6457ae4741967e83e13535.poster.avif?t=1720184434\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842050/extras/ebd397a81c6457ae4741967e83e13535.webm?t=1720184434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842050/extras/ebd397a81c6457ae4741967e83e13535.mp4?t=1720184434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842050/extras/f7a53812162451edc8a04940f8e22c65.avif?t=1720184434\" width=616 height=80 /></span><br>Make your own drink and food recipes to sell! Unlock new ingredients to make high-quality products. Ingredients have their own special attributes like making customer drunk, sleepy, evil or good and more.<br><br>Affect your customers with your products. Make drinks with high alcohol and let everyone fight with each other, or make sweet, no alcohol beverages to more peaceful tavern.<br><br>Guardians will put evil customers to hell and nice customers to heaven.<br>Earn hell or heaven coins by attracting customers to afterlife. Unlock special afterlife furnitures &amp; recruit powerful angels or demons to work for your tavern.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842050/extras/97e07583a6ab7d777254c91e31587d63.poster.avif?t=1720184434\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842050/extras/97e07583a6ab7d777254c91e31587d63.webm?t=1720184434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842050/extras/97e07583a6ab7d777254c91e31587d63.mp4?t=1720184434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
